{"version":1,"key":"card:139","content":{"id":139,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"03b0eabf-c37d-4e1c-86ee-9fc6893d296e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Antd 的 Popover 的显示与隐藏有两种模式：受控模式和非受控模式，当我们主动设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"open"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，就是受控模式，反之不设置 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"open"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，或者设置为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"undefined"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时就是非受控模式。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"TSX","uuid":"ceccc2bc-aa34-450c-b942-ed013156243f","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"60cbb60f-50b6-40c5-871e-e13a8114d15a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 非受控模式\n<Popover\n\ttrigger={'click'}\n  content={'Hello World!'}\n>\n  <Button>点我</Button>\n</Popover>","collabId":"1116f08a-8a11-4a17-8802-98d622807f82","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"d832bed8-1d50-408e-94e3-42cae402a04a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"09b79e74-cedd-4478-b737-b530f30a21be","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 受控模式\n<Popover\n\topen={open}\n  content={'Hello World!'}\n>\n  <Button>点我</Button>\n</Popover>","collabId":"bfc773cc-9ee5-4209-9f71-2f0876b55d46","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6cc393b5-b763-4950-a314-f5ab66ed88d2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在非受控模式下，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Popover"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的显示与隐藏遵循默认的规则，移入或点击元素时显示内容（受 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"trigger"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 控制），移出或点击别处时则隐藏，这个默认行为是极好的，但是有的时候，我们需要主动的控制显示和隐藏，一些默认的行为需要手动去实现，比如点击别处时隐藏卡片内容。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"bacc7e84-cd99-43cb-b0e4-8657cfb0ace7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个实现的思路就是在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"document"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上监听点击事件，如果点击的元素不是卡片上的元素，我们就隐藏"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"9d7e7b3c-31a4-47dd-8b6b-5571145e2bc1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6746097f-c572-4dd2-8128-307733eae679","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const Content = () => {\n  const ref = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  \n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleClickAway = (e) => {\n      if (ref.current && !ref.current.contans(e.target)) {\n        // 关闭弹窗\n      }\n    }\n    document.addEventListener('click', handleClickAway);\n    \n    return () => {\n      document.removeEventListener('click', handleClickAway);\n    }\n  }, [])\n  \n  return (\n  \t<div ref={ref}>\n      Hello World!\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n<Popover\n\topen={open}\n  content={<Content />}\n>\n  点我\n</Popover>","collabId":"233bc90b-3f39-47fb-a44f-3db67c910f21","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"3fdfebe0-211c-4a60-8eaf-3a0d4a7367b9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是奇怪之处在于，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"handleClickAway"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 并没有触发，让我百思不得其解，后面我把 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"document"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 换成了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"document.body"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，事件就触发了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"657a394a-eeae-48eb-9b49-8ebf19707e08","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3d820d0d-cc19-4911-8ce8-ac34fcd6fd55","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const Content = () => {\n  const ref = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  \n  useEffect(() => {\n    const handleClickAway = (e) => {\n      if (ref.current && !ref.current.contans(e.target)) {\n        // 关闭弹窗\n      }\n    }\n    // 此处换成 document.body\n    document.body.addEventListener('click', handleClickAway);\n    \n    return () => {\n      document.body.removeEventListener('click', handleClickAway);\n    }\n  }, [])\n  \n  return (\n  \t<div ref={ref}>\n      Hello World!\n    </div>\n  )\n}","collabId":"ec477af3-1e5c-44b3-9e7c-220cbece6d5d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"536706b8-e276-4ad6-8d05-5d73d88f8695","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"19a924b6-c7a1-4366-974c-b3f3186acf21","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ahook"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"useClickAway"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"hook"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，用法为"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"3e957dfe-9ac8-4ec9-b638-098aa6648f61","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"413a6715-2073-474e-bb37-c8752b188a8d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"useClickAway(fn, ref)","collabId":"c3ce0e36-cb0a-40f5-9735-af3d51e0af45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"94ea12e9-e6a7-4bdd-b29b-75e7b11ca7dc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当点击的地方在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"ref"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 之外，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"fn"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就会触发，我尝试用这个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"hook"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 去关闭弹窗，但是也没用，估计它监听的也是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"document"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的事件。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"tsx","uuid":"8217403e-8135-48cd-8c09-75366084b454","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"be4cadbe-9c0c-4dd0-b3b0-09324e4e1f7d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const Content = () => {\n  const ref = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);\n  \n  useClickAway(() => {\n    // 关闭弹窗\n  }, ref)\n  \n  return (\n  \t<div ref={ref}>\n      Hello World!\n    </div>\n  )\n}","collabId":"49d5a7f4-7648-4d0d-b277-ef0d27412d01","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"4637e0df-87f8-4867-8cea-92e47fcaa75b","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c482fa7b-3143-42e6-8729-14f83c8c3c95","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上面的问题出现在我的工作项目中，可能是谁在 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"document.body"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上阻止了事件冒泡。"}]}]},{"type":"divide-line","tauContract":"e43f9dce629c905e0bcd68c62f974061860b4a4428d1bf3ee0965ca60e23efd0","collabId":"e9146df4-2d67-431e-a444-1f807c0b195b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"aad76aad-84fb-41b0-8690-57806c001589","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"补充："},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Popover"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 支持传递一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"onOpenChange"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的方法，当点击 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Popover"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 外部时会触发 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"onOpenChange"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，并且传递参数 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示关闭，因此也可以传递 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"onOpenChange"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，既可以受控，又可以享受原来已有的功能"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JSX","uuid":"8ccc7471-a767-416a-95a5-5c8e52bccdae","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"abf9a69f-19b2-44ef-87b9-30f73b0d4d0a","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const [open, setOpen] = useState(false);\n\n<Popover\n\topen={open}\n  onOpenChange={setOpen}\n>\n  <div></div>  \n</Popover>","collabId":"31b75dc5-10a1-4d47-9453-fa7a0cf23a5a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["技巧/React","React/antd","React/技巧","antd/Popover"],"createTime":1689599964006,"updateTime":1744171687642,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744171687642}}